  "configuration_id": "config_008",
  "reason": "RNA-only multiprofile avgpool is currently the strongest setting, with scvi_n200 reaching 0.650 accuracy / 0.628 F1 and pca_n2000 reaching 0.591 accuracy / 0.573 F1 under the same profile and aggregation, while image-only models remain much weaker. The main uncertainty is whether the untested scgpt encoder can improve the RNA representation further. config_008 keeps profile_setting=multiprofile and aggregation=avgpool fixed and changes only the RNA encoder to scgpt, directly isolating the representation effect. This is the best next experiment because it exploits the current best setting, has high expected immediate performance, and clarifies which RNA encoder should anchor later multimodal or fusion experiments."
